---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About — Recipe Nutrition Calculator"
	description="Why we built a free recipe nutrition calculator with no login and no paywall — full macros, 20+ micronutrients, and a shareable link for every result."
>
	<section class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-md sm:px-lg py-3xl">
		<h1 class="text-display-lg text-ink mb-lg">About</h1>
		<div class="space-y-md text-body-md text-body">
			<p>
				Recipe Nutrition Calculator exists because the tools we tried either buried the useful detail behind a
				paywall, or made you create an account just to see or share a result. We wanted something that gives
				you the full picture — calories, macros, and micronutrients — for free, instantly, with no login.
			</p>
			<p>
				Every recipe you analyze gets a shareable link automatically. Nothing is tied to an account, because
				there are no accounts.
			</p>
			<p>
				See <a href="/how-it-works" class="text-link hover:underline">how it works</a> for details on where the
				nutrition data comes from and how we handle ingredients we can't match exactly.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
